        "text_pw9BXt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Green Envee was founded on a deep understanding of skin function, nutrient delivery, and barrier support. Every formulation is intentionally developed with advanced plant actives, antioxidant-rich botanicals, and intelligent delivery systems designed to support visible skin transformation and long-term skin health. We believe in combining nature-inspired formulation with scientifically backed ingredients like retinaldehydes, peptides, and antioxidants at effective doses to deliver real, visible results.<br/><br/>Our co-founders, Bob and Tim, grew up surrounded by the forests and natural landscapes of Northern Wisconsin, where holistic living and the healing power of nature were deeply woven into everyday life. Their understanding of wellness became deeply personal when searching for a solution to help soothe and support one of their daughter’s compromised skin barrier and eczema-prone skin.</p>",
            "font_size": 4,
            "text_columns": 1,
            "align_text": "text-center",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_color": "btn--neutral",
            "button_style": "btn--outline btn--long",
            "text_color": "text--neutral",
