    "section_double_DBNMPQ": {
      "type": "section-double",
      "blocks": {
        "text_8ECt9L": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Unable to find products free from unnecessary fillers, artificial fragrance, harsh irritants, and toxic ingredients, they recognized a gap in the skincare industry for formulations that combined clean ingredients with true performance. Driven by a desire to create effective, wellness-driven skincare rooted in both nature and science, Green Envee was founded in 2009 with the creation of Zen Body Lotion.<br/><br/>Created alongside experienced skincare professionals, cosmetic chemists, and herbalists, our philosophy is rooted in the belief that skin should be treated as a living organ - nourished, protected, and optimized at the deepest level. Powered by BioIntelligent Botanicals™ and our proprietary PhytoCatechin Infusion™, an antioxidant-rich Green + White Tea infusion used in place of water, Green Envee combines clinical performance with functional wellness to create antioxidant-dense, barrier-supportive skincare intentionally formulated for transformation.<br/></p>",
            "font_size": 4,
            "text_columns": 1,
            "align_text": "text-center",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "button_color": "btn--neutral",
            "button_style": "btn--outline btn--long",
