        "text_B87b4K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>Every Green Envee formulation is guided by a commitment to transparency, integrity, and uncompromising quality - not only for skin health, but for the health of the environment. Through our Clean Standard, we intentionally eliminate toxins, harsh chemicals, synthetic fillers, and unnecessary irritants while thoughtfully sourcing sustainably harvested ingredients from partners who share our dedication to ethical and environmentally responsible practices.<br/><br/>The result is professional skincare that merges clinical performance with conscious formulation: antioxidant-dense, high-performing products intentionally designed to support visible skin transformation, barrier health, and overall wellness while creating a more mindful impact from soil to skin.<br/></p>",
            "font_size": 4,
            "text_columns": 1,
            "align_text": "text-center",
